# Wave T44 (Honeyfield kit): shopsign — the Mart's hanging shop board, seated at the Mart stamp's east frontage (13,3). Built for the Backstory Sync Audit's Honeyfield build note: the design's Mart reads soft with no clear shopfront, so the build gives the shop its full shopfront sign (no stamp cell, warp or interior touched). Two posts, a crossbar, a blue board with a cream satchel glyph. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in (measured #2a8320). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T44-HONEYFIELD-PLAN.md §5.)
